digraph account_payable_process_159 {
	graph [rankdir=LR]
	START_NODE [label="" shape=circle width=0.3]
	subgraph CLUSTER_0 {
		"send to the vendor accounting department" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" [shape=box]
		"send to the vendor accounting department" -> "create a receiving report"
		"gather the receiving report" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" -> "gather the receiving report"
		"stamp all documents" [shape=box]
		"gather the receiving report" -> "stamp all documents"
	}
	START_NODE -> "send to the vendor accounting department"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"stamp all documents" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following description is about the account payable process. It begins when you send to the vendor accounting department. 
Once sending to the vendor accounting department occurs, creating a receiving report should be done. 
Once creating a receiving report occurs, gathering the receiving report needs to be done. 
Once gathering the receiving report occurs, stamping all documents should be done. 
The process is now completed. 
"
}
